title: 'Claude Code''s Auto Dream (2026, unannounced when written about): a background subagent consolidates the memory files, fixing duplicates, contradictions and stale dates, once at least 24 hours and five sessions have passed since the last.'
pid: 8d31d452-e666-4fd5-b5dd-1e3d5914d3dc
body: |2-
  https://claudefa.st/blog/guide/mechanics/auto-dream
  Summary, from third-party guides that disagree on whether it is on by
  default. During a dream it may write only memory files.
  Took: a gate of time and sessions, not every session.
